trength to cling to your convictions and resist the temptation? Or give in to the lust for power and bring about a birth of an age more terrible than anything that came before?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912820/extras/99d83bee83ab5b93746b09af87024060.poster.avif?t=1768941156\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912820/extras/99d83bee83ab5b93746b09af87024060.webm?t=1768941156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912820/extras/99d83bee83ab5b93746b09af87024060.mp4?t=1768941156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Akeld Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912820/header.jpg?t=1768941156","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Akeld Entertainment & Freedom Games - All Rights Reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2912820/719453/be3b5e940f296ddc1b414ef0dc577addcb5bdb10/1750888442/dash_av1.mpd?t=1726846261","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2912820/719453/be3b5e940f296ddc1b414ef0dc577addcb5bdb10/1750888442/dash_h264.mpd?t=1726846261","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2912820/719453/be3b5e940f296ddc1b414ef0dc577addcb5bdb10/1750888442/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1726846261","id":257034303,"name":"Steam teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257034303/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1726846261"}],"name":"Sages of Vandaleria: Rebirth of an Empire","package_groups":[],"pc_requiremen