was overthrown, it has known only misery and hardship. What it needs is a savior. Embark on an epic RPG adventure, fighting across land and sky, restoring the ancient religion, and retake your birthright! That is, if you are ready to pay the price.","steam_appid":2912820,"support_info":{"email":"support@indie.io","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://akeldentertainment.com/"}